<title>UK: Colonial Mutual sell property assets to UK group.</title>
<headline>Colonial Mutual sell property assets to UK group.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australia's Colonial Mutual Life Assurance Society announced the sale of its UK direct property investment portfolio for more than 130 million stg to a UK consortium.</p>
<p>The buyer group includes GE Capital, Apollo Real Estate Investment Fund and Portfolio Holdings Plc.</p>
<p>The assets represented less than four percent of Colonial's total funds and the sale follows an internal strategic review on the investment side.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
